{"version":1,"title":"标签：Lab5 - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"navbar top\"><div class=\"navbar-blur\"><div class=\"navbar-container\"><nav class=\"post\"><a href=\"/\">近期发布</a><a href=\"/categories/\">分类</a><a class=\"active\" href=\"/tags/\">标签：Lab5</a><a href=\"/topic/\">专栏</a><a href=\"/archives/\">归档</a><a href=\"/recent/\">BAKER</a></nav></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"post-list post\"><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/75baf1d4/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA OS Lab5]文件系统</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>广义上，「文件」是指任何具有唯一标识、且在逻辑上完整的字节序列。在这种「一切皆文件」的思想下，文件系统也不再局限于某一物理媒介，而是将各种差异巨大的资源都统一抽象为「文件」，并为用户提供一套统一的访问接口。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2026-05-18T14:27:54.000Z\">2026-05-18</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\" style=\"--text-p2:#335566;--theme-block:#33556620\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 操作系統</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>","bodyClass":"index","layout":"undefined","type":"undefined","textIndent":false}